# Host automation

Do not move the mouse on the host. Do not click at screen coordinates. Do not send keystrokes.

Automation is scripts and code: tests, the CLI, files, logs, and process checks. Drive Silicon Cellar and Wine through those.

Do not use `CGEvent`, `cliclick`, `osascript` keystrokes, or System Events clicks to press buttons in Silicon Cellar, Wine, or another app.
